msgid "Migration Guide"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Today, we released both Quarkus 2.11.1.Final and Quarkus 2.10.4.Final.\n"
"Quarkus 2.11.1.Final is, despite its name, the first 2.11 release."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Both versions are fixing https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-2-10-3-final-"
"released/[CVE-2022-2466] in the SmallRye GraphQL server extension (for real "
"this time).\n"
"Unfortunately, the previous fix introduced in 2.10.3.Final and the non-"
"released 2.11.0.Final was incomplete and the issue was still present in "
"another form."
msgstr ""

msgid "New Redis Client API"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Default to Java 17-based builder images for native executable generation"
msgstr ""

msgid "Bump to Vert.x 4.3.2 and Netty 4.1.78"
msgstr ""

msgid "Allow passing unsupported properties to Hibernate ORM"
msgstr ""

msgid "Change GraphQL endpoints to be Singleton by default"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Introduce @SearchExtension to configure Hibernate Search through annotated "
"beans"
msgstr ""

msgid "Hibernate Validator - Allow customization of the ValidatorFactory"
msgstr ""

msgid "Allow to provide custom configuration for JAXB context"
msgstr ""

msgid "Various improvements to the Dev Experience"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To migrate from 2.10, please refer to https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"wiki/Migration-Guide-2.11[our migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Quarkus 2.11 introduces a modernized Redis Client API."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The previous one is still available and has been marked as deprecated.\n"
"It will be removed in a few versions."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Have a look at the updated link:/guides/redis[Redis getting started guide] "
"and the link:/guides/redis-reference[Redis reference guide] for more "
"information."
msgstr ""

msgid "Java 17-based builder-images by default"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Quarkus supports both Java 11 and Java 17 for a long while but we kept Java "
"11-based builder images for native executable generation... until now."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Starting with Quarkus 2.11, the images use Java 17 by default.\n"
"You can go back to the Java 11 images by using the `quarkus.native.builder-"
"image` configuration property."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Note that, even if your source code targets Java 11, we recommend to use the "
"Java 17 images."
msgstr ""

msgid "Vert.x 4.3.2, Netty 4.1.78"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Vert.x and Netty are both at the core of Quarkus and have been upgraded "
"respectively to 4.3.2 and 4.1.78."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This particular feature was requested by a lot of users.\n"
"With Quarkus, we tried to curate a validated list of Hibernate ORM that we "
"want to expose and support in both JVM and native modes."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"From time to time, we had users complaining about the unavailability of a "
"particular property (and the workaround was to push this property to a "
"`persistence.xml` but it was not ideal).\n"
"Then, there were two options: either we decided to expose them in a future "
"version of Quarkus or we decided we didn't want to expose them - at least "
"not for now - and that might have been impractical in some use cases."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"It is now possible to declare any properties supported by Hibernate ORM with "
"the `quarkus.hibernate-orm.unsupported-properties` configuration property "
"(which is configurable per persistence unit)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You will have a big warning when doing so and we still encourage you to "
"create issues about the properties you would like to see added and fully "
"supported as that will impact future developments of Hibernate ORM and the "
"Hibernate ORM extension in Quarkus."
msgstr ""

msgid "Customization"
msgstr ""

msgid "We improved the customization abilities of several extensions:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Hibernate Search now has a `@SearchExtension` annotation to be configured "
"through annotated beans."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"It is now possible to customize the Hibernate Validator `ValidatorFactory` "
"with beans implementing `HibernateValidatorFactoryCustomizer`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The JAXB context can also be customized through `JaxbContextCustomizer` "
"beans."
msgstr ""

msgid "GraphQL endpoints singleton"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The GraphQL endpoints used to have the `@Dependent` CDI scope by default, "
"which was suboptimal.\n"
"They are now `@Singleton` by default."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can go back to the previous behavior by adding the `@Dependent` "
"annotation to your GraphQL endpoints."
msgstr ""

msgid "Dev Experience"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When using the Hibernate Search and Elasticsearch devservices, the "
"Elasticsearch schema is now re-created on startup in tests and dev mode."
msgstr ""

msgid "The ArC Dev UI now presents a bean dependency graph."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Dev Services datatabase, username and password are now unified across all "
"supported databases and can be configured."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get the full changelog of https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/2.11.0.CR1[2.11.0.CR1], https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/2.11.0.Final[2.11.0.Final] and https://github.com/quarkusio/"
"quarkus/releases/tag/2.11.1.Final[2.11.1.Final] on GitHub."
msgstr ""

